# check-wm-lane-boundary.shs: ratchet gate against the WM/GUI/web/2D
# portable-lane boundary regressing further than its recorded baseline
# (doc/08_tracking/wm_lane_boundary_baseline.txt). Fixed 2026-08-08 after
